[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_script")
entry_name = "Lua Modules"
description = "Lua organizes code into modules using require. A module is a file that returns a table.

Requiring a module:

local math = require(\"math\")\nprint(math.pi)

Creating a module (myfile.lua):

local M = {}\nfunction M.greet(name)\n    return \"Hello \" .. name\nend\nreturn M

Requiring your module:

local myfile = require(\"myfile\")\nprint(myfile.greet(\"World\"))

The module system caches modules, so requiring the same module twice returns the same table."
keyword = "require"
language = "lua"
category = "Medium"
